{"slug":"/students/subjects/government/government/","source":"students/subjects/government/government.html","area":"students","kind":"division","title":"Government — Dashboard","description":"","subject":"government","body":"!..make a modal appear. it should give proper attribution to Phet simulations..!\n  <nav class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-blue-100 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <nav class=\"text-sm text-blue-600\">\n            <a href=\"/students/student-dashboard/\" class=\"hover:underline\">Dashboard</a>\n            <span class=\"mx-2\">/</span>\n            <span class=\"font-semibold\">Government</span>\n          </nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative\">\n            <span class=\"mi -search text-slate-400 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\" data-mi=\"search\">search</span>\n            <input aria-label=\"Search\" class=\"pl-10 pr-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white\" placeholder=\"Search government topics\">\n          </div>\n          <img src=\"/site/assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" class=\"h-10 w-auto\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 pb-12\">\n    <header class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 to-blue-400\">Government</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Understanding political systems and governance</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/government/government-topic/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Elements of Government</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Nature, scope, organs, types</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/government/government-topic/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Political Development</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Political parties, pressure groups, elections</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/government/government-topic/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Government Institutions</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Legislature, executive, judiciary</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/government/government-topic/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Government in Nigeria</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Pre-colonial, colonial, post-independence</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/government/government-topic/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">International Relations</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Foreign policy, international organizations</p>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n\n      .topic-card { padding: 16px; }\n    }","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-blue-100 font-inter","bodyStyle":"","css":[],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}